# Flames for the Dead (battlefield.flames_for_the_dead, Bearclaw Pinnacle: a BattlefieldMission, index 0, 30 minutes,
# entry NPC Wind_Pillar_1, exit Wind_Pillar_Exit). A level 75 Warrior with Three Paths current and Ulmia's field at 8 (a
# GM): the menu 32000; option 0 gets only the event release, option 4 an event update (params [5]) and the release,
# option 1 enters area 1. Tick 2000, then the Snoll Tzar is killed (the trace moves the char: a position change and
# afterZoneIn, no event yet). Five ticks of 2000 later the win: 32001; finished: Three Paths' Bearclaw handler moves
# Ulmia's field 8 to 9, title 364 and 1000 XP.
lists BearclawPinnacle/Wind_Pillar_1/onTrigger BearclawPinnacle/onEventUpdate/32000 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32000 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=BearclawPinnacle pos=-720,9,-441 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop ThreePaths current
login
missionstatus Cop 8 pos=4               # a GM: Ulmia's field 8
trigger Wind_Pillar_1
update 32000 option=0
update 32000 option=4
update 32000 option=1
finish
tick 2000
kill SNOLL_TZAR_OFFSET
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
finish
tick 11000
tick 10000
